  "limitations": [
    "The prior-inventory field copies no previous transaction operations or nonce claims. All current account/Qi journals must be explicitly supplied.",
    "Automated consistent collection across browser stores and coordinated live restoration remain separate work.",
    "The existing recovery format preserves allocation floors and inventory, not old allocator request IDs or pending search work.",
    "Prior backup encoded size plus selected public journals share the 16 MiB input budget; normal full-backup limits remain.",
    "Fuzz recapture uses fixed toy ownership and the same validated predecessor; conflicting ancestry/ranges are covered deterministically.",
    "The sanitizer run is a bounded smoke with a 65536-byte input cap, no attacker-selected password KDF and LeakSanitizer disabled.",
    "No public-network transaction or real funds used."
